OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSevere gales
OL,6,Fgradually abating in northwest
OL,7,FScotland with rain moving southeast
OL,8,Finto Northern Ireland and southern
OL,9,FScotland by the morning. Clear spells
OL,10,Fand showers following to the far
OL,11,Fnorthwest by dawn. Largely dry and
OL,12,Fvery mild across England and Wales.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FRain, often heavy, edging
OL,15,Finto northern England and Wales.
OL,16,FBrighter and cooler conditions
OL,17,Ffollowing to Northern Ireland and much
OL,18,Fof Scotland. Unseasonably warm across
OL,19,FEngland and Wales. Windy in places.
